OL,3,CBeach-goers urged to stay out of water
OL,4,Cafter oil spill report
OL,6,FPeople are being urged not to bathe at
OL,7,Fa Northumberland beach after reports
OL,8,Fof a possible oil spill.
OL,10,FThe Environment Agency is
OL,11,Finvestigating a pollution incident at
OL,12,FBlyth South Beach and has taken
OL,13,Fsamples for analysis.
OL,15,FIn a statement it added: "As a
OL,16,Fprecaution, we are urging people,
OL,17,Fparticularly dog owners, to avoid the
OL,18,Faffected area until we know more about
OL,19,Fthe substance and any potential risks.
OL,26,@wD@ZOU
