OL,3,CBeach-goers urged to stay out of water
OL,4,Cafter oil spill report
OL,6,F"Advice against bathing in waters at
OL,7,Fthis location is also in place while
OL,8,Four investigations continue."
OL,10,FAn incident was logged on the
OL,11,FEnvironment Agency water quality
OL,12,Fwebsite on Tuesday 11 August.
OL,14,FThe Port of Blyth says it is liaising
OL,15,Fwith the Environment Agency and
OL,16,FNorthumberland County Council in
OL,17,Frelation to the ongoing investigation.
