PN,39403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F394A1786745072
OL,3,CBeach-goers urged to stay out of water
OL,4,Cafter oil spill report
OL,6,FNorthumberland County Council said in
OL,7,Fa statement: "The Environment Agency
OL,8,Fhas made us aware of a pollution
OL,9,Fincident at Blyth Beach.
OL,11,F"A strong-smelling substance has been
OL,12,Fidentified after forming a sheen in
OL,13,Fpools of water and on the sand.
OL,15,F"Investigations are ongoing, but as a
OL,16,Fprecautionary measure we are asking
OL,17,Fvisitors to the area not to bathe in
OL,18,Fthe water at this time."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/3
